# ==========================================================================
# WayMaker Ink — waiver forms
# ==========================================================================

# --- Secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
# Real values live in the Dokploy environment panel, never in the repo.
# .env.example is the committed template — keep it free of real values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Service-account and OAuth material, if any ever lands here
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key

# --- Generated at runtime ------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: public/config.js is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the committed
# local-dev fallback carrying Cloudflare's public "always passes" test key;
# docker-entrypoint.sh overwrites it inside the running container, which never
# touches the working tree.

# --- OS / editor cruft ----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Word and Excel leave these behind while a file is open
~$*
.~lock.*#

# Claude Code per-machine settings; a shared .claude/settings.json (if one is
# added) should stay tracked.
#
# The leading **/ matters. A pattern containing a slash is anchored to the
# directory holding this .gitignore, so a bare `.claude/settings.local.json`
# would match only the one at the root and silently commit every nested copy.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
